Brief Explanation

Two pointers are used:

slow moves 1 step at a time
fast moves 2 steps at a time


If there is a cycle, fast will eventually meet slow → return true
If fast reaches null, the list has no cycle → return false

Complexity

Time Complexity: O(n)
(Each node is visited at most once)
Space Complexity is O(1)
Thank you
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
public class Solution {
    public boolean hasCycle(ListNode head) {
        ListNode fast=head;
        ListNode slow=head;
        while(fast!=null && fast.next!=null){
            slow=slow.next;
            fast=fast.next.next;
            if(fast==slow){
                return true;
            }
        }
        return false;
    }
}
        
    
